{
  "id": "dialogue.hiori.ideal",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "歩む先には理想の自分",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.ideal",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.ideal",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就是把灯织引上这条路的那个人吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "是的。那时候的我只是看着……现在觉得，好像靠近了一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不过，离理想还是很远……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……说起来，还有件事一直没听到答案。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你说过想要喜欢上什么。现在呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "现在……喜欢上了很多东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "事务所的伙伴、应援的粉丝。为了回应他们而站上舞台……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……还有，制作人的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "啊，不是，那个……！不是恋爱的感情，是作为可以信赖的搭档，是这个意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我当然明白。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能被灯织信任我很高兴，而且……你找到了自己喜欢的东西，这比什么都好。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "说实话……我以前觉得，自己什么都不会喜欢上。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "如果还是以前一个人的我，一定会一直那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "可是，制作人改变了我。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "制作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "真的，非常感谢……！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，我只是帮了一点忙。改变的是灯织自己。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以……你可以更喜欢自己一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……好！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "现在，我一点点……能感觉到自己在喜欢自己。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "那种时候，我会觉得非常幸福——",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我明白了，原来我从一开始就想这样喜欢自己。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "和制作人一起，我觉得能学会更喜欢自己。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "所以，今后也请对我多多关照。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……！当然！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "辛苦了。水，带来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "制作人，非常感谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "首次演出的反响真大啊，工作邀约蜂拥而至。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "杂志封面、采访、音乐节目……忙得不可开交！……怎么了，灯织？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "啊……对不起，稍微走神了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么了？是累了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不，不是那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……我想起了中学时看到的那个偶像。想着，那个人是不是也这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
